{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-12"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810926-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","missionId":"event-rogue-12","mission":"사채발행기 (2)","scene":"사채발행기 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"스타피스 컴퍼니 이사회의 이사 「흉터 부인」이 당신의 맞은편에 앉아있다. 왼쪽 눈에 기다란 흉터가 난 그녀가 당신을 관찰하는 시선이 느껴진다","talkId":403810926,"textHash":"3352426381390961776","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:12/talk-403810926","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0dfcbf0b33773b78","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810927-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其二）","bwikiRevision":58313,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9527","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (2)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810927-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","missionId":"event-rogue-12","mission":"사채발행기 (2)","scene":"사채발행기 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「다시 날 찾아왔군. 그리 오래 기다리지 않을 줄 알고 있었어」 그녀가 깍지 낀 두 손을 턱에 댄 채, 이미 예상하고 있었다는 눈빛으로 당신을 바라본다","talkId":403810927,"textHash":"11743666773639958207","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:12/talk-403810927","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0dfcbf0b33773b78","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810928-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其二）","bwikiRevision":58313,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9527","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (2)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810928-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","missionId":"event-rogue-12","mission":"사채발행기 (2)","scene":"사채발행기 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「천사형 사채발행기에 정기적으로 갖고 있는 골드를 집어넣으면 발행기가 투자 금액을 기록할 거야. 그리고 기간이 끝나면 당신은 보답으로 투자 금액의 수십 배를 얻게 되는 거지」","talkId":403810928,"textHash":"7297433957441238573","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:12/talk-403810928","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0dfcbf0b33773b78","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其二）","bwikiRevision":58313,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9527","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (2)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-text-8972167857162033310-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","missionId":"event-rogue-12","mission":"사채발행기 (2)","scene":"사채발행기 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"살래","talkId":null,"textHash":"8972167857162033310","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:12/text-8972167857162033310","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"229f2b6525fd0795","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其二）","bwikiRevision":58313,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9527","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (2)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810926-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810927-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-talk-403810928-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-12-text-8972167857162033310-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":4,"reviewRows":0,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}